  "about": {
    "bioEn": [
      "Audrey is a cinematographer, raised between Spain, China, France and the Caribbean, based in Los Angeles. (EU passport / US O-1B)",
      "Shooting on both film and digital, she is an ASC Heritage Award and Laszlo Kovacs Award nominee.  A two-time Panavision grant recipient, her work has screened at AFI Fest, EnergaCamerimage, Palm Springs Short Fest, Zagreb Film Festival, Raindance, and Urbanworld.",
      "Audrey attended the American Film Institute Conservatory as a Fulbright/Georges Lurcy Scholar and is the recipient of an ASC Vision mentorship."
    ],
